    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play As Pixelmons!</strong></h2><br>Warriors of Nova Thera is a roguelike action-adventure where you play as Pixelmons! Explore and battle your way through the different biomes and discover exciting encounters. Collect shardstones from your expeditions out into the wild and use them back in the game hub to unlock upgrades and become stronger. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913760/extras/6b9edf744f71f49f0466f888c4e4f651.avif?t=1723117063\" width=512 height=190 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE WILDERNESS</strong></h2>The wilderness is populated with wild and aggressive Pixelmon! Face off against a variety of enemies and bosses that will test your strategic thinking and reflexes as you progress deeper into the unknown. <br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913760/extras/225efde2643f1716f4b9ac168d68852a.avif?t=1723117063\" width=512 height=264 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INFINITE REPLAYABILITY</strong></h2>Each playthrough offers a unique experience with varying upgrades found through each run, ensuring no two adventures are the same.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913760/extras/b7926f7e442937c6e728d51a3af36568.avif?t=1723117063\" width=512 height=232 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKILL TREE PROGRESSION</strong></h2>Each Pixelmon has their own unique playstyle with different abilities and skill trees. Spend shardstones from your runs to upgrade your Pixelmon and unlock stronger versions of your abilities. <br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913760/extras/abc4918b49cdfe6aa51c26270efc5f7e.avif?t=1723117063\" width=512 height=344 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUNE SYSTEM</strong></h2>Improve your Pixelmons by equipping Runes obtained from your runs which provide powerful stat upgrades!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play As Pixelmons!</strong></h2><br>Warriors of Nova Thera is a roguelike action-adventure where you play as Pixelmons! Explore and battle your way through the different biomes and discover exciting encounters. Collect shardstones from your expeditions out into the wild and use them back in the game hub to unlock upgrades and become stronger. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913760/extras/6b9edf744f71f49f0466f888c4e4f651.avif?t=1723117063\" width=512 height=190 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE WILDERNESS</strong></h2>The wilderness is populated with wild and aggressive Pixelmon! Face off against a variety of enemies and bosses that will test your strategic thinking and reflexes as you progress deeper into the unknown. <br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913760/extras/225efde2643f1716f4b9ac168d68852a.avif?t=1723117063\" width=512 height=264 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INFINITE REPLAYABILITY</strong></h2>Each playthrough offers a unique experience with varying upgrades found through each run, ensuring no two adventures are the same.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913760/extras/b7926f7e442937c6e728d51a3af36568.avif?t=1723117063\" width=512 height=232 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKILL TREE PROGRESSION</strong></h2>Each Pixelmon has their own unique playstyle with different abilities and skill trees. Spend shardstones from your runs to upgrade your Pixelmon and unlock stronger versions of your abilities. <br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913760/extras/abc4918b49cdfe6aa51c26270efc5f7e.avif?t=1723117063\" width=512 height=344 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RUNE SYSTEM</strong></h2>Improve your Pixelmons by equipping Runes obtained from your runs which provide powerful stat upgrades!",
